    }
  },
  "limitations": "Proposal, not callable: apply requires an existing trained node, identical saved roles, inputs:[], no Teach, fresh current-source execution. Training modes require explicit Teach. Ports 0/1 are tables; variable port 2 is the summary. Auto method, auto penalties, calibration/scoring, bindings and categorical predictors remain pending their separate cycle. Summary classification error needs owner decision."
